            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "We're not going to do extra work for Windows 7 support. However, that qt6windows7 doesn't support svg. We use svg a lot in qtox, but I'm willing to look into getting rid of that (runtime) dependency and turn it into a build-time dependency, mainly for security reasons, but as a side-effect, it'll become easier to port to Windows 7 as well.",
