        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I tried using [Qt 6.8.1 for Windows 7](https://github.com/crystalidea/qt6windows7/) and replacing all DLLs in v1.18.3, but while this works without crashing on Win10, it does not run on Win7, with error: `The procedure entry point _Z14qAddPreRoutinePFvvE could not be located in the dynamic link library Qt6Core.dll` (NB. I replaced Qt6Core.dll with the Win7 patched one, so no idea why it's not working\n\nThat said, I was able to run Qtox v1.18.3 with Qt6.8.1 for Windows 7 without crashing on Win10",
            "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:20:32Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/TokTok/qTox/issues/419#issuecomment-3349098161",
            "id": 3349098161,
