        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Qt itself not supporting Windows 7 is a major deal-breaker, and I don't know any developers around here interested in that either.\n\nIf you find ways to run it on that OS, you're of course free to share your findings, but I don't think there will be any official support for it, and I'd recommend you move to something that makes a bit more sense.  :]\n",
            "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:28:53Z",
