        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Sandboxie Plus uses Qt 6.8.3 for Windows 7 since [v1.16.3](https://github.com/sandboxie-plus/Sandboxie/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#1163--5713---2025-09-08), which seems to work pretty well in this case. Its developer had consulted the community before making this decision. [He also concluded](https://forum.xanasoft.com/threads/drop-windows-7-support-yes-no.2902/#post-17215) that even Windows 10 LTSB 2016 would have problems with Qt 6 for Windows 10.",
